5
00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:14.070
Niccole Mucci is about to show us around her hometown

6
00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.970
of Orlando, Florida.

7
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.810
She's a mom and the creator of a website

8
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.470
