10
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.293
Watch this.

11
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:28.690 line:15%
Welcome to Orlando!

12
00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:31.010 line:15%
My name's Niccole Mucci and I am the Owner

13
00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.150 line:15%
