15
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.220
I love Orlando because it's diversified.

16
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.620
There's so much to do for families.

17
00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:41.900
I'm gonna take you on a little tour.

18
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:42.733
Let's go.

19
00:00:44.619 --> 00:00:47.220
Welcome to the town of Celebration!

20
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.180
This place is amazing.

21
00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:52.700 line:15%
It's located right next to the Disney area,

22
00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:53.800 line:15%
