27
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.663
and have some great restaurants to visit and places to stay.

28
00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.760
I am here at Lake Eola Park in the downtown part of Orlando.

29
00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:19.000 line:15%
We love coming here to just hang out at the park,

30
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.550 line:15%
