34
00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:33.960
Hi guys, and welcome to Wekiwa Springs State Park.

35
00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.966
It's a great place to come, get away from the beach,

36
00:01:36.966 --> 00:01:38.760
