38
00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.240 line:15%
I've been coming here since I was in high school,

39
00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:48.090 line:15%
and we love that the springs are 75 degrees year round.

40
00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.540
It's the perfect place to be.

41
00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:51.960
Drew, thanks so much for coming

42
00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.620
