45
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.230
See you soon.

46
00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:03.140
Thanks, Niccole.

47
00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:04.680
We love Orlando.

48
00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.630
And of course, I've been numerous times with my daughters

49
00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:11.310
to go to none other than Disney World, Universal,

50
00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.330
